    "quote": "Given a Copeland bandit problem satisfying Assumption {\\bf A} and any $\\delta > 0$ and $\\alpha > 0.5$, with probability $1-\\delta$, the regret accumulated by CCB is bounded by the following: A_\\delta^{(1)} + A_\\delta^{(2)} \\sqrt{\\ln T} + A^{(3)} \\ln T \\leq A_\\delta^{(1)} + A_\\delta^{(2)} \\sqrt{\\ln T} + \\frac{2K(C+L_C+1)}{\\Delta^2} \\ln T."
   },
   "confidence": "high",
   "notes": "Regret w.r.t. Copeland winner. The paper also states an expected regret O((K^2+(C+L_C)K ln T)/Delta^2) (Eq. 1) for alpha>1 obtained by integrating delta, but not as a formal statement."
